}\pard\plain\s0\qj\widctlpar\f0\fs20\sl240\slmult1 \sb60 \fi40 Based on our prior work and GTH product distribution over various catalysts, surface Pd and acidic sites of H-ZSM-5 are proposed to be active sites. Since only one catalyst (Pd/H-ZSM-5), with specific Pd metal loading amount (wt%=5%) and specific metal dispersion (D%=29.7%), was used in kinetics measurements, the TOF and reaction rate for a specific step (R1-R4) are inter-converted. Because all kinetics measurements were conduced differential operating conditions, corresponding to conversion = 5-10 %. The rate of a differential reaction is thus calculated by Eq. ({\field{\*\fldinst{\lang1024 REF BMEq3 \\* MERGEFORMAT }}{\fldrslt{3}}})\par
