}\pard\plain\s3\ql\sb240\sa120\keepn\f0\b\fs32\sl240\slmult1 \sb480 \fi0 5  Concluding Remarks\par
\pard\plain\s0\qj\widctlpar\f0\fs20\sl240\slmult1 \sb120 \fi0 In the present work, differential kinetic experiments were carried out for glycerol to hydrocarbon fuels conversion. A reaction pathway and kinetic model were developed based on experimental observation and modeling. Reaction orders and activation energies for each step in the proposed pathways were calculated. Thee model predicted data match well with experimental results. This work provides a practical model for converting glycerol, as biodiesel by-product, to hydrocarbon fuels.\par
